Changes in version 2024.8.20

- Author: TDH
- is.matrix() instead of class()=="matrix" in multiBinSeg.
- multiBinSeg error for too many changes.
- document multiBinSeg cost, J.est is cost decrease.
- remove Rprintf from Heap.cpp.

Changes in version 2020.4.8

- Author: TDH
- update DESCRIPTION Authors@R, Description from CRAN version.

Changes in version 2020.4.3

- Author: TDH
- fix memory leak (remove delete poly from Liste destructor, only delete next if it is not NULL).
- fix cost computation and docs, now J.est is the total square loss and the cost is the total square loss plus the penalty constant times the number of segments.

Changes in version 2019.05.03

- Register BinSeg_interface in src/Rwrappers.cc -- this function is used with .C, and was formerly known as Call_BinSeg (renamed to avoid confusion because .Call is not used).

